---
title: Checkout
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor customer as Customer
    participant web as Web app
    participant api as Orders API
    participant pay as Payments
    customer->>web: Place order
    web->>api: POST /orders
    api->>pay: Charge card
    pay-->>api: charged
    api->>api: Save order
    api-->>web: 201 Created
    web-->>customer: Confirmation
